t-foreground mb-4">Built by Polyfactual</h2><p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">Products we&#x27;ve created for the prediction market ecosystem</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 rounded-full" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 text-primary"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">Polymarket Grant Recipient</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><a href="https://facts.trade" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-xl transition-all h-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal w-7 h-7 text-primary"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="20" y1="19" y2="19"></line></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Facts.trade</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Prediction Market Trading Terminal</p></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Trade prediction markets with just an email. No wallet extensions, no gas fees. Magic Link auth with auto-deployed Gnosis Safe wallets on Polygon.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5"><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Limit &amp; Market Orders</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Real-Time Orderbooks</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Cross-Chain Deposits</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Wallet Tokenization</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary text-sm font-medium group-hover:gap-3 transition-all">Visit Facts.trade <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link w-3.5 h-3.5"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></span><a href="https://x.com/factsdottrade" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary/50 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"><img alt="X" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/x-logo.svg"/></a></div></div></a><a href="https://factsai.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-xl transition-all h-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain w-7 h-7 text-pri