ass="group block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 h-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chrome w-7 h-7 text-primary"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><line x1="21.17" x2="12" y1="8" y2="8"></line><line x1="3.95" x2="8.54" y1="6.06" y2="14"></line><line x1="10.88" x2="15.46" y1="21.94" y2="14"></line></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Polyfactual Extension</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">AI Investment Analysis for Chrome</p></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Chrome extension providing AI-powered investment analysis directly on Polymarket. Scrapes real-time market data and delivers Buy / Hold / Avoid recommendations with confidence scores.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5"><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Live Market Scraping</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Buy/Hold/Avoid</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Confidence Scores</span><span class="text-xs px-2 py-1 bg-muted rounded-md text-muted-foreground">Floating Panel</span></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">Chrome Extension</span></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-6"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 fl